uggestion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/58e830edb4a5dcf82f41eedf9afda1b6.avif?t=1759876608\" data-has-big width=800 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/c5e5d90a99527cf73d8ee9c44f653e4a.poster.avif?t=1759876608\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/c5e5d90a99527cf73d8ee9c44f653e4a.webm?t=1759876608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/extras/c5e5d90a99527cf73d8ee9c44f653e4a.mp4?t=1759876608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catastrophes are coming in hot\u2014sometimes literally. You could rise to the occasion and douse the flames (both metaphorical and real)\u2026 or just let it all burn in glorious chaos. But, uh, maybe grab the fire extinguisher. Just a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re flying solo or teaming up with a friend, one thing\u2019s for sure: things are about to get bumpy. Tray tables up and buckle up. This is your captain speaking: <strong><i>good luck.</i></strong></p>","developers":["Bomas Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582430/d43cacecff76df968678e9388b0f4725d8e4733e/header.jpg?t=1759876608","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 15<br></li><li><strong>Processo